  "mathNotation": "r(\\phi) = \\left( \\left|\\frac{\\cos(m\\phi/4)}{a}\\right|^{n_2} + \\left|\\frac{\\sin(m\\phi/4)}{b}\\right|^{n_3} \\right)^{-\\frac{1}{n_1}}",
